{"step_index":71,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-08T20:55:04Z","input_tokens":2824,"cache_read_tokens":70930,"output_tokens":1125,"content":"The Firebase-backed Quiz Web Application is ready for Vercel deployment.\n\n### Summary of Implementation\n\n1. **[firebase-config.js](file:///c:/Users/CxAdmin/Desktop/Exploit/firebase-config.js)**:\n   - Configured Cloud Firestore using the provided Firebase project credentials (`sir-jasper-quiz`) via Google's official modular Web SDK (`gstatic`).\n   - Exports data synchronization helpers (`getActiveQuiz`, `saveActiveQuiz`, `saveSubmission`) and fallback defaults.\n\n2. **[index.html](file:///c:/Users/CxAdmin/Desktop/Exploit/index.html) (Student Quiz Site)**:\n   - Faithful visual clone matching the design tokens (`--bg`, `--card`, `--tx`, `--mu`, `--pr`, `--ok`, `--bad`, `--bd`) and dark mode from [`QUIZ06 (1) (1).html`](file:///c:/Users/CxAdmin/Desktop/Exploit/QUIZ06%20(1)%20(1).html).\n   - Fetches active questions, distractors, and rules from Firebase Firestore.\n   - Per-question countdown timer with animated progress bar.\n   - Anti-cheat tab-switching violation tracking with point penalties and warning modal.\n   - Auto-randomization of questions and answer options.\n   - Result screen with base64 result code (`btoa`), `.json` download, and question-by-question feedback.\n   - Duplicate attempt lockout stored in local storage with `#reset-quiz` hash bypass for testing.\n\n3. **[teacher.html](file:///c:/Users/CxAdmin/Desktop/Exploit/teacher.html) (Teacher Portal & Editor)**:\n   - Built with the exact same design language and card system.\n   - Dynamic, auto-numbered question cards (`Question 1`, `Question 2`, ...).\n   - Tap-and-type input boxes for Question prompt, **Correct Answer** (accented in green), and 3 **Wrong Answers** (distractors).\n   - Prominent **`+ Add Question`** button to append new questions with sequential auto-numbering.\n   - **Options** button displaying a configuration drawer:\n     - Auto Randomize Questions toggle.\n     - Auto Randomize Answers toggle.\n     - Switching Tab Violation toggle & penalty deduction input.\n     - Timer toggle & seconds-per-question input.\n   - **Save to Firebase** button syncing active quiz data directly to Firestore.\n   - **Load Default C Quiz** button to populate or restore the original 20 items.\n\n4. **[vercel.json](file:///c:/Users/CxAdmin/Desktop/Exploit/vercel.json)**:\n   - Configures clean URLs and zero-build static deployment on Vercel.\n\n5. **[HISTORY.md](file:///c:/Users/CxAdmin/Desktop/Exploit/HISTORY.md)**:\n   - Documented as Major Patch 1.0.0 per Rule 1.\n\n---\n\n### Verification & Test Results (Rules 3, 9 & 10)\n\n- **Rule 9 Enforcement**: Scanned all created source files (`firebase-config.js`, `index.html`, `teacher.html`, `vercel.json`); verified 0 in-code comments, docstrings, or TODO/FIXME markers.\n- **Rule 2 & 12 Compliance**: The original [`QUIZ06 (1) (1).html`](file:///c:/Users/CxAdmin/Desktop/Exploit/QUIZ06%20(1)%20(1).html) file was left unmodified.\n- **Firestore Live Verification**:\n  - Successfully connected to Firestore `projects/sir-jasper-quiz/databases/(default)/documents/quizzes/active`.\n  - Seeded and verified all 20 default C switch-case quiz questions with distractors and explanations (HTTP 200).\n- **HTTP Server Verification**:\n  - Served all files locally and verified status 200 for `index.html`, `teacher.html`, `firebase-config.js`, and `vercel.json`.\n\n### How to Test & Deploy to Vercel\n1. You can test immediately by opening [index.html](file:///c:/Users/CxAdmin/Desktop/Exploit/index.html) or [teacher.html](file:///c:/Users/CxAdmin/Desktop/Exploit/teacher.html) in any browser (or serving via `npx serve .`).\n2. To deploy to Vercel, push this folder to your GitHub repository and import it into Vercel, or run `vercel` via the Vercel CLI from this directory."}
