{"step_index":87,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-08T21:02:36Z","input_tokens":2732,"cache_read_tokens":76970,"output_tokens":614,"thinking":"Testing direct imports from a CDN within HTML to isolate the issue. Evaluating if loading firebase modules directly from a CDN like `gstatic.com` in `test_direct_module.html` bypasses the problem. This will help determine if the problem lies within the local module import process or the Firebase modules themselves. Also opening `test_fetch.html` in Chrome/Edge to check for consistent behavior.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"\"<!DOCTYPE html>\\n<html>\\n<head><title>Test Module Direct</title></head>\\n<body>\\n<div id=\\\"status\\\">Testing direct module...</div>\\n<script type=\\\"module\\\">\\n  try {\\n    const { initializeApp } = await import(\\\"https://www.gstatic.com/firebasejs/10.14.0/firebase-app.js\\\");\\n    const { getFirestore, doc, getDoc } = await import(\\\"https://www.gstatic.com/firebasejs/10.14.0/firebase-firestore.js\\\");\\n    \\n    const firebaseConfig = {\\n      apiKey: \\\"AIzaSyBkqJ9WvtXfGJt19XK7SLK9v5cJwp4EVII\\\",\\n      authDomain: \\\"sir-jasper-quiz.firebaseapp.com\\\",\\n      projectId: \\\"sir-jasper-quiz\\\",\\n      storageBucket: \\\"sir-jasper-quiz.firebasestorage.app\\\",\\n      messagingSenderId: \\\"932129654171\\\",\\n      appId: \\\"1:932129654171:web:793aa17dd1f130a62f4d3e\\\"\\n    };\\n\\n    const app = initializeApp(firebaseConfig);\\n    const db = getFirestore(app);\\n    const snap = await getDoc(doc(db, \\\"quizzes\\\", \\\"active\\\"));\\n    if (snap.exists()) {\\n      document.getElementById(\\\"status\\\").textContent = \\\"GSTATIC MODULE SUCCESS: \\\" + snap.data().title;\\n    } else {\\n      document.getElementById(\\\"status\\\").textContent = \\\"GSTATIC SNAP DOES NOT EXIST\\\";\\n    }\\n  } catch (err) {\\n    document.getElementById(\\\"status\\\").textContent = \\\"GSTATIC ERROR: \\\" + err.message;\\n  }\\n</script>\\n</body>\\n</html>\\n\"","Path":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\CxAdmin\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\8f2bd4b5-d81b-4839-aa40-a5c3a5acaa6a\\\\scratch\\\\test_direct_module.html\""}}]}
